#
# Conformance case: kind-hierarchy
# Exercises basic sort projection: a 3-level Kind/SubKind hierarchy with a
# RigidSortal (SubKind) and a Role, plus a subClassOf chain.

@prefix logic: <https://blackcatinformatics.ca/logic/> .
@prefix ex:    <https://example.org/kind-hierarchy/> .
@prefix rdf:   <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#> .
@prefix rdfs:  <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#> .
@prefix owl:   <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#> .

# Sorts
ex:Animal   a logic:Kind .
ex:Mammal   a logic:SubKind .
ex:Dog      a logic:SubKind .
ex:Pet      a logic:Role .

# Subsumption chain: Dog → Mammal → Animal
ex:Dog    logic:subClassOf ex:Mammal .
ex:Mammal logic:subClassOf ex:Animal .

# Role applies to the Kind
ex:Pet logic:subClassOf ex:Animal .
